A||||1||Ed||Sears Point, CA, Fiero Car Corral||||1||
Z||000000||Ed||03-08-2001||06:12 PM||||Fiero owners are invited to participate in the Fiero "Car Corral" at Sears Point Raceway on Sunday, May 20.  These are the "Chrysler-Jeep Wine Country Classic Vintage Car Races."  <P>I went to one day of the races (Friday, practice day) last year and it was great.  I did post a report which should be available in the archives.  <P>The deal is that an area is set aside for a car "marque" such as the Fiero.  Only that marque can park there.  So don't bring your pickup truck unless its a Fiero!  We get discounted tickets to the event, $15 per person and this separate place to park.  I'll post more info here if you want, or e-mail me directly or talk to George Miller at his Fiero Shop. Also see <A HREF="http://www.searspoint.com." TARGET=_blank>www.searspoint.com.</A> <P>If you do want to go, I'll need a check by March 30 to be able to make arrangements.  E-mail me for specifics.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Ed||03-09-2001||05:12 PM||||Second and last notice.||||reg||1
